  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>제4회 재과만 오프라인 행사에 함께 해주셔서 고맙습니다!<br>&#160;<br>행사 일시 : 2023.1.11(수)&#160; 오후 2시~5시<br>&#160;<br>행사 장소 : 청주교대<br>&#160;<br>행사 내용 : 재과만 회원 대면 만남 및 재과만 사례 발표&#160;<br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#39; 교사 전문성을 키우는 5가지 키워드&#39;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>네 분의 재과만 강사님들이 기꺼이&#160;</p><p>발표자료를 공유해주셨습니다~</p><p>고맙습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3237967e0e07b8f4fd24baf66da1ff18274b2545\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3237967e0e07b8f4fd24baf66da1ff18274b2545\" data-origin-width=\"804\" data-origin-height=\"238\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/32e5d019666399731a25d417d4336675c03d90b3?download\" data-file-name=\"청주교대 발표(김신혜).pdf\" data-file-size=\"6352089\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfBlk%26dataid%3D60%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20230114124003&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F32e5d019666399731a25d417d4336675c03d90b3')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">청주교대 발표(김신혜)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">6.06MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec3c32f001d333744452bb35a262e1d259ad7926?download\" data-file-name=\"청주교대 재과만 발표 원고(부산 용문중 김신혜).pdf\" data-file-size=\"142360\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfBlk%26dataid%3D60%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20230114124003&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fec3c32f001d333744452bb35a262e1d259ad7926')\"><div class=\